[MESSAGE]
	[TITLE]Please click 'Accept' to allow internet access.[/TITLE]
	[TEXT]In order to play World of Padman datafiles are needed. World of Padman is a mod/total conversion based on the Quake 3 engine.

Click Accept, to download the World of Padman datafiles, which can be freely downloaded from the internet.
[/TEXT]
[/MESSAGE]
